text = [
    "(You hear voices echoing from #the depths...)",
    "Ah, yes, sir, points of #isolation are, in fact, #a feature, not a bug!",
    "You see, these FAITH PLATEs #can be used to deter would-be #burglars as well!",
    "After all, what better use for #a platform with no way down",
    "than to trap burglars right #where they stand?",
    "Of course, there is admittedly #a minor risk of the good guys #getting trapped there,",
    "which is why I'm offering you #this Guide to One-Way Mazes for #an incredibly hefty discount!",
    "Say... $39,998, which includes, #might I add, full reading AND #applying rights!",
    "I'm actually losing money #selling this to you so cheap!",
    "So how about it, gentlemen?&Combo Forward Advancement and #Iniquitous Thief Hindrance...",
    "(The voices fade into the #abyss.)"
];
